# Content bundle

Read: `docs/CONTENT-SYNC.md`, `docs/schemas/`, skill `stickera-content-bundle`.

- Bump `catalog.version` and album `revision` on any sticker/image change
- Every sticker: `nameKey` under `albums.*` + keys in `en.json` and `pt.json`
- Images WebP under `albums/{id}/stickers/`
- IDs: `album-id:NN` slug album `^[a-z0-9]+(-[a-z0-9]+)*$`

Conformidade: `docs/SPEC-VALIDATION.md` §1 antes de marcar álbum pronto.
